D s-parame.adb		20260807074606 91a902b3 system.parameters%b
G a e
G c Z s b [default_stack_size system__parameters 67 13 none]
G c Z s b [minimum_stack_size system__parameters 70 13 none]
G c Z s b [adjust_storage_size system__parameters 73 13 none]
